  m_Name: Choice 3 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SoChoice
  optionText: Do I have to defend myself? Does this thing know something about me?
    I need to get ready... (Assumes a defensive stance)
  positiveConsequence: The shadow stops in front of him and stares at him for a few
    moments. Then, the mysterious being vanishes, just like all the other shadows
    in the place.
  negativeConsequence: The shadow lunges at the knight, raining down blows. Although
    the knight parries every attack and the assailant vanishes immediately after,
    his resolve to press on and endure the tortuous journey fades significantly.
